		(descr "OEM-replacement-style analog thumbstick with center-push switch (ALPS RKJXV1224 / C&K THB001P footprint family). 2-axis potentiometer-emulation interface: pins 1/2/3 = X axis low/wiper/high, pins 1'/2'/3' = Y axis low/wiper/high, pins a/c = switch (b/d are mechanically-redundant duplicate switch legs, left unconnected). Adapted from dbenoy/thumbstick-breakout (CC-BY-SA 4.0, Copyright (c) Daniel Benoy), which itself used the C&K THB001P datasheet for dimensions. Verify against your physical part before fab.")
