		(property "Description" "OEM-replacement-style hall/TMR analog thumbstick with center-push switch (ALPS RKJXV1224 / C&K THB001P footprint family). 2-axis potentiometer-emulation interface, not a simple VCC/GND/X/Y/SW breakout: pins 1/2/3 are the X axis low/wiper/high, pins 1'/2'/3' are the Y axis low/wiper/high, pins a/c are the switch (b/d are mechanically-redundant duplicate switch legs, intentionally unconnected). Drive 1 and 1' to GND, 3 and 3' to 3V3; read wipers 2 (X) and 2' (Y) on ADC pins; wire switch a to a GPIO and c to GND. Adapted from dbenoy/thumbstick-breakout (CC-BY-SA 4.0, Copyright (c) Daniel Benoy)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
